      "widgets_values": [
        "SenseNova-U1.5-8B-MoT-BF16-T8.safetensors",
        "Create a vertical editorial poster in a calm eco-spiritual mood, approximate 4:5 portrait format, on warm off-white recycled paper with visible fibers, stains, dust speckles, folded-paper aging and subtle print grain. The central image is a close side-profile portrait of a young woman from chest to head, positioned slightly right of center and facing left, eyes closed, chin lifted, breathing peacefully. Her dark wet-looking hair is messy and windblown, with loose strands crossing her face; she wears a dark simple shirt and a small hoop earring. Her skin is warm bronze, softly lit from the left/front, with natural highlights on nose, lips, cheekbone and neck. Blend the portrait into an organic double-exposure collage: the top of her hair and head dissolves into a dark misty conifer forest with tall pine silhouettes rising upward, fog and smoky ink clouds, black and ochre paint splatters, torn edges and semi-transparent grunge textures. Behind her head place a muted tan circular sun/moon disk, partly hidden by her profile. Above the circle and forest add a flock of small black birds flying diagonally across the upper left sky.\\n\\nUse an asymmetrical magazine/poster layout with generous negative space on the left and technical micro-typography around the edges. On the left middle, set the main title in large condensed distressed uppercase black sans serif, stacked in three lines: \\\"NATURE\\\" / \\\"HEALS\\\" / \\\"EVERYTHING\\\". Below it add small monospaced text: \\\"take a breath\\\" \\\"and remember\\\" \\\"who you are.\\\" with tiny dot markers and thin vertical rule elements. Top left include tiny terminal-style text: \\\"// INNER_PEACE_16\\\", \\\"status: free\\\", \\\"mode: breathe\\\", \\\"version: 2.0.1\\\" and a short row of square progress blocks. Bottom left include a small decorative barcode-like block and \\\"v 2.0.1\\\". On the right edge add narrow technical annotations: top text \\\"BE PRESENT\\\", a vertical dotted guide line, a column of small hexadecimal-style status rows ending with \\\"ok\\\", three small dots, thin rules, a circular black icon with horizontal beige stripes, and lower right text \\\"be wild / be free / be you\\\" with tiny square blocks. Add faint cursive handwriting overlays across the lower portrait and right side, used as texture rather than fully readable text. Keep all typography crisp where specified, but keep microcopy tiny and functional. Avoid any brand logo, QR code, watermark, platform badge, real signature, extra large text, glossy modern UI look, cartoon rendering, over-saturated colors, or clean sterile background.",
        false,
        1024,
        1760,
        2368,
        43,
        true
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "ckpt_name": "SenseNova-U1.5-8B-MoT-BF16-T8.safetensors",
        "text_1": "Create a vertical editorial poster in a calm eco-spiritual mood, approximate 4:5 portrait format, on warm off-white recycled paper with visible fibers, stains, dust speckles, folded-paper aging and subtle print grain. The central image is a close side-profile portrait of a young woman from chest to head, positioned slightly right of center and facing left, eyes closed, chin lifted, breathing peacefully. Her dark wet-looking hair is messy and windblown, with loose strands crossing her face; she wears a dark simple shirt and a small hoop earring. Her skin is warm bronze, softly lit from the left/front, with natural highlights on nose, lips, cheekbone and neck. Blend the portrait into an organic double-exposure collage: the top of her hair and head dissolves into a dark misty conifer forest with tall pine silhouettes rising upward, fog and smoky ink clouds, black and ochre paint splatters, torn edges and semi-transparent grunge textures. Behind her head place a muted tan circular sun/moon disk, partly hidden by her profile. Above the circle and forest add a flock of small black birds flying diagonally across the upper left sky.\\n\\nUse an asymmetrical magazine/poster layout with generous negative space on the left and technical micro-typography around the edges. On the left middle, set the main title in large condensed distressed uppercase black sans serif, stacked in three lines: \\\"NATURE\\\" / \\\"HEALS\\\" / \\\"EVERYTHING\\\". Below it add small monospaced text: \\\"take a breath\\\" \\\"and remember\\\" \\\"who you are.\\\" with tiny dot markers and thin vertical rule elements. Top left include tiny terminal-style text: \\\"// INNER_PEACE_16\\\", \\\"status: free\\\", \\\"mode: breathe\\\", \\\"version: 2.0.1\\\" and a short row of square progress blocks. Bottom left include a small decorative barcode-like block and \\\"v 2.0.1\\\". On the right edge add narrow technical annotations: top text \\\"BE PRESENT\\\", a vertical dotted guide line, a column of small hexadecimal-style status rows ending with \\\"ok\\\", three small dots, thin rules, a circular black icon with horizontal beige stripes, and lower right text \\\"be wild / be free / be you\\\" with tiny square blocks. Add faint cursive handwriting overlays across the lower portrait and right side, used as texture rather than fully readable text. Keep all typography crisp where specified, but keep microcopy tiny and functional. Avoid any brand logo, QR code, watermark, platform badge, real signature, extra large text, glossy modern UI look, cartoon rendering, over-saturated colors, or clean sterile background.",
